pseudocode:
// 1. fit detectors $\{m_1, \ldots, m_K\}$ from {IForest$\times$3, KNN$\times$3, HBOS, COPOD, LODA, PCA}
// 2. for each $m_k$:  $s_k(X) \leftarrow m_k.\text{decision}(X)$;  store sorted train scores
// 3. ranks $r_k(x) = \text{searchsorted}(s_k^{sorted}, s_k(x))/(n+1)$
// 4. compute pairwise correlation $C_{ij} = |\mathrm{corr}(r_i, r_j)|$ on train
// 5. $\bar c_k = (\sum_j C_{kj} - 1)/(K - 1)$;  $w_k \propto 1/(\bar c_k + 0.1)$;  normalize $\sum w_k = 1$
// 6. consensus $= \sum_k w_k r_k(x)^2$;  sensitivity $= \max_k r_k(x)$
// 7. score $= 0.7\,\text{consensus} + 0.3\,\text{sensitivity}$

// 1. fit IForest, COPOD, KNN with $k = \min(20, \sqrt{n})$
// 2. $\rho \leftarrow \overline{|\mathrm{corr}(X)|_{i\ne j}}$;  $\gamma \leftarrow \overline{|\mathrm{skew}(X_{:,j})|}$;  $\hat\gamma = \min(\gamma/5, 1)$
// 3. $w_{cop} = \rho$;  $w_{iso} = (1-\rho)(1-\hat\gamma)$;  $w_{knn} = \hat\gamma$;  normalize $\sum w = 1$
// 4. for each detector $d$:  $\mu_d, \mathrm{IQR}_d \leftarrow$ median, IQR of $d.\text{decision}(X)$
// 5. at decode:  $z_d(x) = (d.\text{decision}(x) - \mu_d)/\mathrm{IQR}_d$
// 6. score $= \max\big(w_{iso} z_{iso}, w_{cop} z_{cop}, w_{knn} z_{knn}\big)$

// 1. fit $K=3$ models: IForest(n_est=200), ECOD(), COPOD()
// 2. for each model $m_k$:  $s_k^{train} \leftarrow m_k.\text{decision}(X_{train})$;  store $\mathrm{sort}(s_k^{train})$
// 3. at decode:
// 4.   $r_k(x) = \mathrm{searchsorted}(\mathrm{sort}(s_k^{train}),\, m_k.\text{decision}(x))/n_{train}$
// 5.   consensus $= \overline{r_k}$;  $r_{max} = \max_k r_k$
// 6.   score $= (\text{consensus} + r_{max})/2$

// 1. compute per-feature ECDF on train; $U = F(X) \in [\epsilon, 1{-}\epsilon]$;  $Z = \Phi^{-1}(U)$
// 2. tail$(U)$: $T_s$ = mean of top-$r$ $|\log U|$ entries, $T_d$ = $\overline{|\log U|}$;  tail $= 0.65 T_s + 0.35 T_d$;  conc $= T_s/T_d$
// 3. seed $= 0.55\,\text{tail} + 0.25\max|Z| + 0.20\overline{Z^2}$
// 4. iterate $\le 2$ rounds: keep $80 - 4\log(d)$th percentile by seed as core; fit on core: $k_{small/large}$-NN radii, $\mu, \Sigma^{-1}$ (LedoitWolf), PCA(.85 var), IForest($Z$) and IForest($X$)
// 5. parts vector: [tail, max(0, (tail $-$ neighbor median tail)/MAD), local-NN ratio, $\Delta z^\top \Sigma^{-1} \Delta z$, $\overline{(Z - \mathrm{recon})^2}$, $\max($IForest$_Z$, IForest$_X)$]
// 6. robust $z = \mathrm{clip}(($parts$ - \tilde\mu)/(1.4826\,\mathrm{MAD}), -5, 20)$;  weight by core-vs-full $P_{95}/P_{80}$ contrast
// 7. gate $= \sigma(2.5(\text{conc} - \text{conc}_{ref})/\text{MAD})$;  score $= (1-\text{gate})\,\text{diffuse} + \text{gate}\,\text{sparse} + 0.10\max z$

// 1. fit detectors: ECOD (inductive), IForest($n_{est}=\min(200,\max(100,n/10))$, max_samples=$\min(256,\max(64,n/4))$), COPOD, and 3 LODA models with seeds {43, 44, 45} (n_bins=10, n_random_cuts=8)
// 2. on train: $s_k(X) \leftarrow$ each detector's score; rank_matrix = column-stack of per-detector ranks of train scores
// 3. compute pairwise Pearson $C_{ij} = |\mathrm{corr}(r_i, r_j)|$ with zero diagonal
// 4. diversity weights: $w_k = (1/(1 + \overline{C_{k,\cdot}}))$, normalize $\sum w = 1$
// 5. at decode: rank each detector's score against sorted train scores, then $\text{score} = \sum_k w_k\,r_k(x)$ (matrix product `rank_matrix @ self.weights`)
